rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\'t have to find the card if you don\'t want to."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a “[subtype] spell” or “[subtype] card,” it refers only to a spell or card that has that subtype. For example, Goblin War Party is a card that references and creates Goblins, but it isn\'t a Goblin card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you tap City of Brass while you are casting a spell or activating an ability, its ability will trigger and wait. When you finish casting that spell or activating that ability, City of Brass\'s triggered ability is put on the stack on top of it. City of Brass\'s ability will resolve first."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'On the other hand, you can tap City of Brass, put its triggered ability on the stack, and then respond to that ability by casting an instant or activating an ability using that mana. In that case, the instant spell or activated ability will resolve first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The first ability triggers no matter how the land becomes tapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'A creature that must attack each turn, must only attack once that turn. It is not forced into each attack that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when a creature attacks, blocks, or is blocked will trigger during each combat that turn. Thus, a creature with Rampage will get the bonus added during each attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you manage to cast this during a main phase of your opponent\'s turn, that opponent\'s creatures will untap and that opponent will be able to attack again. It will not allow you to attack during their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only creates an additional combat and main phase if it resolves during a main phase.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A source of damage is a permanent, a spell on the stack (including one that creates a permanent), or any object referred to by an object on the stack. A source doesn’t need to be capable of dealing damage to be a legal choice.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used even when there is no damage to prevent. It prevents the next damage (if any) from the source this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'All damage being dealt to you at one time gets redirected to one Pariah. If you take 3 damage at once, all 3 damage goes to one Pariah. If you take damage from multiple creatures in combat, all the combat damage goes to one Pariah.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can attach this to an opponent’s creature, and all damage done to you is instead done to their creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Always affects the player and targets one of their opponents.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each point of damage is dealt separately, so if you are damaged twice by this spell, each time is considered a separate time this source deals damage.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card’s coin flip has no winner or loser.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2006-10-15', 'text': 'Can fetch a snow land.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used on a player with less than 2 cards in their library. It will remove 0 or 1 cards if that is all that is available.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is not a draw effect so it will not cause a player with less than 2 cards in their library to lose.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since you are putting more than one card in the graveyard at one time, the affected player can choose the order the 2 cards go in.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used on artifact creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can sacrifice itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target an already tapped creature if you want.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Creatures are only put into a graveyard for having 0 toughness when state-based actions are checked. If Maro’s toughness goes to 0 during the announcement or resolution of a spell or ability and then goes back up above 0 before the end of that announcement or resolution, it won’t be put into your graveyard when state-based actions are checked.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Gaining life is optional. If you forget, you can’t go back later even if it is something you usually do.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Gang of Elk gets the bonus once for each blocker.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Having multiples of these on the battlefield means you can play an additional land for each one.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a land is tapped for mana and sacrificed all in one action, it goes to the graveyard before the Cauldron can return it to the player’s hand.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a land is tapped for mana, it is returned to its owner’s hand as a triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Howling Mine leaves the battlefield before it resolves, then the last known tap or untap state of the card is used for resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does not trigger at all if this is tapped at the start of the draw step, and it checks this again on resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional draw is separate from any other draw during your draw step. It happens when the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature has more than one creature type, and one of those types matches the creature you are calculating for, then count that creature. Only one type needs to match in order to get counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you have a creature with more than one creature type, count all creatures which have either creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sharing multiple creature types doesn\'t give an additional bonus. Coat of Arms counts creatures, not creature types."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell is countered, it still counts as having been cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell is countered, it still counts as the one spell cast.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'When Arcane Laboratory enters the battlefield, it will look back over the turn to see if any spell was cast before it entered the battlefield. It will notice itself being cast.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'When it leaves the battlefield, the effect ends and all players are able to cast spells unrestricted again.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If animated so it is a creature, it can be triggered off its own destruction.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If it attacks more than once per turn, it gets the bonus each time.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If more than one of these is on the battlefield, the controller sacrifices a creature for each one of these.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the controller has no other lands or creatures on the battlefield, they must sacrifice the creature that just entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the creature changes controllers before this ability resolves, its new controller has to sacrifice something.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Tainted Aether’s controller is the one that controls its triggered ability, but the controller of the creature that entered the battlefield chooses what creature they sacrifice during resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple “extra turn” effects resolve in the same turn, take them in the reverse of the order that the effects resolved.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you end up skipping the extra turn that is gained, you do not lose the game.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the player has no cards in hand, this has no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are less than 7 cards in the library, look at all of them. Put two into your hand, and the rest in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not considered a draw or a discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are two of these on the battlefield, they do not add together. The result is that only two permanents can be untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there is no other legal target for the spell, this does not change the target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Once the spell resolves, the new target is considered to be targeted by the deflected spell. This will trigger any effects which trigger on being targeted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The target of a spell that targets another spell on the stack can be changed to any other spell on the stack, even if the new target will resolve before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This does not check if the current target is legal. It just checks if the spell has a single target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This only targets the spell being changed, not the original or new target of the spell it is affecting.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose to make a spell on the stack target this spell (if such a target choice would be legal had the spell been cast while this spell was on the stack). The new target for the deflected spell is not chosen until this spell resolves. This spell is still on the stack when new targets are selected for the spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t make a spell which is on the stack target itself.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the spell to target on announcement, but you pick the new target for that spell on resolution.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'If a spell targets multiple things, you can’t target it with Deflection, even if all but one of those targets has become illegal.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'If a spell targets the same player or object multiple times, you can’t target it with Deflection.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you activate the ability but Kjeldoran Royal Guard leaves the battlefield before combat damage is dealt, the combat damage from unblocked creatures won’t be redirected. It will be dealt to you as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have more than one of these, each effect triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do your normal draw before this ability is put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you play Mana Short in response to a spell, it will have no effect on that spell since the mana has already been paid.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It even taps lands that do not produce mana.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since this is an instant, your opponent may use instants in response to the casting of this spell. Note that such spells and abilities will be resolved before the mana pool is emptied by the Mana Short. This makes it useless as a countermeasure for spells. To use it effectively, you need to use it during Upkeep and even then it will not prevent the use of instant spells and abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It affects Elves controlled by all players, not just yours.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'This card is now an Elf but has been reworded so that it does not give itself the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can use its tap ability to untap itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It counts how many cards you discard. Since this card will not be in your hand at that time, this card is not counted.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It destroys one of your enchantments if you are the only player with any enchantments.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Nothing happens if there are no legal enchantments to target when it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It gets the bonus only once, not once per creature it blocks.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It only affects damage dealt by the source one time. If the source damages you a second time this turn, the damage will not be reversed.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It reduces your life total to 1, not the damage to 1.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Worship does not prevent damage. It causes some damage to be unable to lower your life total. So any damage rendered useless by Worship was still dealt and is counted by effects that track the amount of damage done to a player. In addition, Worship does not prevent loss of life, so loss of life bypasses Worship.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Multiple War Drums are not cumulative. They are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'When combined with an effect that reads "Each creature you control can\\\'t be blocked by more than one creature," none of your creatures can be blocked.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'No it is not a Falcon creature type. It is a Bird.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'On resolution, all black creatures on the battlefield get the bonus. Ones that enter the battlefield later in the turn do not get it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Paying to make the Wall capable of attacking does not override the normal rule that a creature may not attack unless it began your turn on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Players take 0 or 2 damage. Disorder does not do 2 damage per creature to the player.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Regenerating artifacts can regenerate from this.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability is not optional. You have to choose one of your own lands if your opponent has none.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability itself is controlled by Mana Breach’s controller.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The person who cast the spell chooses which of their lands is affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability triggers on a black card being discarded, milled, or countered, as well as a black card going to the graveyard from the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional mana is not an ability of the land and is not something the land can produce.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The color is chosen on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature being brought back is chosen on announcement and not on resolution of the spell because it is targeted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You must show the card you bring out of the graveyard to your opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creatures are counted on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The decision of whether to tap or untap is made on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The decision whether or not to tap or untap is made on resolution. This is not a modal spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not a toggle effect. If you use Twiddle to tap a card and before it takes effect your opponent taps it, Twiddle will not automatically untap the card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The first sentence is a continuous ability. You reveal the card when you draw it, during the resolution of any draw effect. The second sentence is a triggered ability, and thus will wait until the entire draw effect finishes resolving before you do it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The payment is optional.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The power of the creature is checked on activation and on resolution. If the targeted creature’s power is not 4 or greater on resolution, the ability doesn’t resolve.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The swamps are counted on resolution.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The amount of damage dealt to a creature is not bounded by its toughness, and the amount of damage dealt to a player is not bounded by that player\'s life total. For example, if Corrupt deals 6 damage to a 2/2 creature, you\'ll gain 6 life."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The life you gain is equal to the damage dealt by Corrupt, not necessarily to the number of Swamps you control (if some or all of the damage is prevented, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'Corrupt counts any land you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The toughness is continuously calculated.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a triggered mana ability. It does not go on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not a targeted ability, so it deals damage to creatures that can’t be targeted by spells and abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not modal. If the target changes from an artifact to an enchantment or vice versa, this still destroys it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not modal. You do not have to choose the target type. The target has to either be a land or non-black creature when announced and on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This spell is cast during the End step. Since you discard down to 7 cards in the cleanup step, this card is used before the discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'When combined with an effect that reads “Each creature you control can’t be blocked except by two or more creatures,” none of your creatures can be blocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Whether or not a creature has flying is only checked on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Whether or not a creature is without flying is only checked on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'X can be zero.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast this if you have less than 2 life, since the life is lost as an effect and not a payment.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast this if you have less than 3 life, since the life is lost as an effect and not a payment.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can sacrifice zero permanents if you want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can use it on yourself.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not take the 3 points of damage if the ability doesn’t resolve because the target is illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Goblin King now has the Goblin creature type and its ability has been reworded to affect *other* Goblins. This means that if two Goblin Kings are on the battlefield, each gives the other a bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If you attempt to halve a negative life total, you halve 0. This means that the life total stays the same. A life total of -10 would remain -10.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': \'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A "creature card" is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type Creature, even if it has other types such as Artifact or Enchantment. Older cards of type Summon are also Creature spells.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The ability is put on the stack immediately after you cast a creature spell, which means the creature that spell will become won’t be a legal target.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The ability will still resolve even if the spell that triggered it gets countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type Creature, even if it has other types such as Artifact or Enchantment. Older cards of type Summon are also Creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you control 0 swamps, then the Nightmare has 0 toughness and will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action right before the next player gains priority.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s power and toughness changes as the number of Swamps you control changes.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s ability counts all lands you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability that defines Nightmare’s power and toughness works everywhere, not just on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now uses the Reach keyword ability to enable the blocking of flying creatures. This works because a creature with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Because combat damage resolves immediately after it is assigned, you cannot sacrifice Blood Pet in between assigning and dealing combat damage. The last chance you have to sacrifice it before combat damage is dealt is during the Declare Blockers step.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Spellbook onto the battlefield, you’ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If an attacking creature loses haste, perhaps because Fervor leaves the battlefield after attackers have been declared, it won’t be removed from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Affected creatures lose all other colors and are mono-black.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of Pyrotechnics, the number of targets and division of damage can’t be changed. The effect that creates the copy may allow you to change the targets, however.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If some but not all of Pyrotechnics’s targets become illegal, you can’t change the division of damage. Damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets simply isn’t dealt.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You choose how the damage is divided as you cast the spell, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Memory Lapse has a self-replacement effect that replaces the spell going to the graveyard before any other effect can replace that event. If the spell was cast using flashback, however, flashback will change the spell\'s destination from its owner\'s library to exile."}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'All creatures on the battlefield when Nausea resolves are affected. Ones that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn are not.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'As blockers are declared, any creature that’s tapped or affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, no player is forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block if that cost isn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Lure doesn’t give any creatures the ability to block the target creature. It just forces those creatures that are already able to block the creature to do so.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting or cycling the card you drew."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If blocked by a creature with banding, the defending player decides whether or not the damage is assigned “as though it weren’t blocked”.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When assigning combat damage, you choose whether you want to assign all damage to blocking creatures, or if you want to assign all of it to the player or planeswalker this creature is attacking. You can’t split the damage assignment between them.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can decide to assign damage to the defending player or planeswalker even if the blocking creature has protection from green or damage preventing effects on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to draw cards and then discard cards, you can’t take actions in between. For example, if you have no cards in hand and cast Faithless Looting, you can’t activate Seismic Assault’s ability between the time you draw two cards and discard those two cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Ensnaring Bridge\'s effect checks the number of cards in your hand only while a player (including you) is declaring attackers. Once a creature has legally attacked, changing its power or the number of cards in your hand won\'t remove it from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Jalum Tome\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen in between, and no player can choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'As long as Revenant is in your graveyard, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Revenant is dealt lethal damage at the same time as another creature you control, both die at the same time. The other creature won\'t die in time to raise Revenant\'s toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Revenant\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a permanent doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Gaining control of an Aura or Equipment doesn\'t change what it\'s attached to."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they’re casting a spell or activating an ability, no player may take other actions until the spell or ability has been paid for. Notably, other players can’t try to tap that player’s permanents to stop them from paying {T} or to stop them from producing enough mana.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to activate Opposition’s ability, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The triggered ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals any damage, not only combat damage.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Unlike the lifelink ability, the ability of Spirit Link is a triggered ability that goes on the stack and may be responded to. Notably, if the enchanted creature deals damage at the same time you’re dealt enough damage to reduce your life total to 0 or less, you’ll lose the game before you can gain any life.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Feroz\' Bann", \'text\': \'Kreaturenzauber kosten beim Ausspielen {2} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Feroz ist schon lange tot, aber sein Abschiedsgeschenk an sein Volk überlebte: das Recht, alleinegelassen zu werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182935&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa36e6c-289e-431c-90f3-6f6d42dbb18f\', \'multiverseId\': 182935}, \'multiverseid\': 182935}, {\'name\': \'Edicto de Féroz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edec438a-88e8-4483-932a-bc978bedd3fe\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bannissement selon Feroz\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de créatures coûtent {2} de plus à jouer.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Feroz est parti mais il a laissé un dernier cadeau à son peuple : le droit à rester seuls.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184351&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83e2c719-3bf7-4d0a-bdaf-2763df774e2b\', \'multiverseId\': 184351}, \'multiverseid\': 184351}, {\'name\': \'フェロッズの封印\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0ee4995-c62c-45ea-8434-73d688418217\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Maldição de Feroz\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c2d1c12-cdc5-4cc8-a35c-51685ca1022e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': "Ketos\' Zauberbuch", \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wissen ist Macht." —Sir Francis Bacon, Meditationes Sacrae\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3710bd7-0575-425f-ada7-feb0bcfbad47\', \'multiverseId\': 182945}, \'multiverseid\': 182945}, {\'name\': \'Volumen de Jayemdae\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21db8175-a861-4fcb-a0d8-8d1e9d464ddb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Savoir, c\'est pouvoir. » —Sir Francis Bacon, Meditationes Sacrae.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184361&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1937d9d8-f7ef-4d55-8b48-9e962334c31a\', \'multiverseId\': 184361}, \'multiverseid\': 184361}, {\'name\': \'ジェイムデー秘本\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb289654-6c3a-4eef-ad56-f16c47433b59\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Livro de Jayemdae\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8ddf44-15f1-48a6-91ce-c64752275235\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ablenkung\', \'text\': \'Ersetze das Ziel eines Zauberspruches deiner Wahl durch ein einzelnes Ziel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast dein Netz nach dem falschen Fisch ausgeworfen." —Der Herrscher von Atlantis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182709&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1646c226-6c0c-4799-bab3-160778edf9f8\', \'multiverseId\': 182709}, \'multiverseid\': 182709}, {\'name\': \'Redirigir\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef76ea93-92a8-4c00-83c3-6bf529f7feef\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Déflexion\', \'text\': \'Choisissez une nouvelle cible pour le sort ciblé qui a une cible unique.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Vous avez jeté votre filet sur le mauvais poisson. » — Le seigneur de l\'Atlantide.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0168116e-effa-4261-8e65-89ef0981a595\', \'multiverseId\': 184125}, \'multiverseid\': 184125}, {\'name\': \'偏向\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7049e667-bdf2-4210-825d-3136866f60e1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Deflexão\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7338a732-a100-4d26-8b8c-d87e15388125\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Abtrünniger Zauberer', 'text': '{T}: Der Abtrünnige Zauberer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Er verschwendet sein ungeheuerliches Talent damit, zu beweisen, wie ungeheuerlich er wirklich ist.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182734&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0370f7d-557d-4445-a86c-0c87b8d5d308', 'multiverseId': 182734}, 'multiverseid': 182734}, {'name': 'Hechicero pródigo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b14e5217-8d83-4f89-8466-b38499295f93'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sorcier sybarite', 'text': '{T}: Le Sorcier sybarite inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : sorcier', 'flavor': 'Tant de puissance dépensée pour épater la galerie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184150&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43a9b424-28e6-48ef-9292-da9782df3d1a', 'multiverseId': 184150}, 'multiverseid': 184150}, {'name': '放蕩魔術師', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf3b4199-836c-4196-bd98-71aab0bc4677'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Feiticeiro Pródigo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21cb0ece-7b9f-45cc-938f-2e07d0549778'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Adarkarwüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein farbloses Mana.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W} oder {U}. Die Adarkarwüste fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb9bb69-a5d9-40f6-b3e7-f517943469cc\', \'multiverseId\': 182965}, \'multiverseid\': 182965}, {\'name\': \'Yermos de Adarkar\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc83f84-7962-4fc7-b948-6ff61d604380\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Landes d\'Adarkar", \'text\': "{T}: Ajoutez un mana incolore à votre réserve.\\n{T}: Ajoutez {W} ou {U} à votre réserve. Ces Landes d\'Adarkar vous infligent 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b8e3f1-99b9-45e3-8ca6-503841bd6ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 184381}, \'multiverseid\': 184381}, {\'name\': \'アダーカー荒原\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3181312-abba-43cf-828a-2a7df4e62022\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Regiões Agrestes de Adarkar\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d9f1ee-e800-47ac-8745-1a0b1157a7f4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aladins Ring\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Aladins Ring fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Manche sagen, dass Aladins dritter Wunsch dieser Ring war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'742ce0c3-e5e8-4755-ac17-84f2e44ceab4\', \'multiverseId\': 182926}, \'multiverseid\': 182926}, {\'name\': \'Anillo de Aladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3096ac83-2f2a-4010-a756-5b481686e844\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Anneau d\'Aladdin", \'text\': "{8}, {T}: L\'Anneau d\'Aladdin inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Cet anneau, mon fils, te sauvegardera de tous les dangers et te préservera de tout mal. (…) » — Les Mille et une Nuits.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184342&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1757d18-08c3-4fe7-8a1b-dfc5b4c2b680\', \'multiverseId\': 184342}, \'multiverseid\': 184342}, {\'name\': \'アラジンの指輪\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2d37eb-4bd8-446f-bf56-8f608227b9f3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anel de Aladim\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b2de4b-ab11-4405-a1ab-2feac4494740\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altdruide\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}, {T}: Tappe oder enttappe ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich mag dir weise erscheinen, aber ich bin nur ein Grünschnabel unter all den mächtigen Eichen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f45bf3-11ef-4db3-acdc-fc1032672fa9\', \'multiverseId\': 182878}, \'multiverseid\': 182878}, {\'name\': \'Alto druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03075413-fd27-41a3-9166-eeb4e3d20eae\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Doyen des druides\', \'text\': "{3}{G}, {T}: Engagez ou dégagez l\'artefact ciblé, la créature ciblée, ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Je vous parais sage mais je ne suis qu\'une simple pousse entre de puissants chênes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184294&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb7e506-8033-4137-99d8-46802022c644\', \'multiverseId\': 184294}, \'multiverseid\': 184294}, {\'name\': \'上座ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf9d2c3a-0ca2-4572-8707-da0c1a604a8c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Druida Ancião\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935a8e8d-7d2a-4a70-800b-d9239864017a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alter Silberrücken\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regeneriere den Alten Silberrücken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe\', \'flavor\': \'Die Phyrexianischen Mordmaschinen hatten keine Ahnung, was für ein Fehler es war, den Affen zu verletzen. Sie hatten ihn ja auch noch nie wütend gesehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc34840-67d4-4844-a939-60a80f23845b\', \'multiverseId\': 182870}, \'multiverseid\': 182870}, {\'name\': \'Lomo plateado antiguo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a41dbd2f-63d3-4312-9e0b-24d9dd7d2a54\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vieux gorille à dos argenté\', \'text\': \'{G}: Régénérez le Vieux gorille à dos argenté.\', \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe\', \'flavor\': "Les machines phyrexianes firent l\'erreur de blesser le vieux mâle au lieu de le tuer d\'un coup.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184286&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb251c6-8869-4671-a2f2-d917ededd303\', \'multiverseId\': 184286}, \'multiverseid\': 184286}, {\'name\': \'年経たシルバーバック\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad33263a-bd93-4269-808a-55f88d5bb375\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Gorila Ancião de Dorso Prateado\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5ac380-c672-4ea4-97e6-0a04540f03e5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anakonda\', \'text\': \'Sumpftarnung (Diese Kreatur ist unblockbar, solange der verteidigende Spieler einen Sumpf kontrolliert.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis\', \'flavor\': \'Du wirst nie eine Anakonda in einem Sumpf finden. Sie wird dich immer zuerst finden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ae8add-ab49-4253-96d7-b601f5177c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 182869}, \'multiverseid\': 182869}, {\'name\': \'Anaconda\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befa92c4-86a5-4cd6-adb0-47aa2c82f913\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anaconda\', \'text\': \'Traversée des marais (Cette créature est imblocable tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins un marais.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : serpent\', \'flavor\': "Vous ne trouverez jamais un anaconda dans un marais. C\'est lui qui vous trouvera en premier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184285&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22928be2-40e6-47a2-b2aa-5c8359b1b20a\', \'multiverseId\': 184285}, \'multiverseid\': 184285}, {\'name\': \'アナコンダ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce77eec8-c7bf-4ad6-86b7-316f8f84b62c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anaconda\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a1c8ad-ce9f-4ec8-ba85-b42d7dc56b00\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anbetung\', \'text\': \'Wenn du eine Kreatur kontrollierst, reduziert aller Schaden, der deine Lebenspunkte auf weniger als 1 reduzieren würde, stattdessen deine Lebenspunkte auf 1.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Glaube an das Ideal, nicht an das Idol." —Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182696&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51cad08-9dae-460a-a6c7-7b01faa5d547\', \'multiverseId\': 182696}, \'multiverseid\': 182696}, {\'name\': \'Adoración\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61141688-0ebf-4f08-8d02-99f830c45980\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Adoration\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez au moins une créature, les blessures qui devraient réduire votre total de points de vie à moins de 1 le réduisent à 1 à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Croyez en l\'idéal, pas en l\'idole. » —Serra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8182ebb-f672-4625-8c41-26659b5bf98c\', \'multiverseId\': 184112}, \'multiverseid\': 184112}, {\'name\': \'崇拝\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3d50dd-dc98-46ab-afde-1bece386755c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Adoração\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3766db92-e494-4cf4-9ad7-ad995af49343\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archivar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wissen ist ein Fest fürs Hirn. Genieße jedes Stückchen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182701&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfab789e-3980-443d-ad3f-710a5b56b7c2\', \'multiverseId\': 182701}, \'multiverseid\': 182701}, {\'name\': \'Archivero\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82db6dc9-9993-4469-bd69-3eb331cd8a35\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Archiviste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Fouiller dans les archives de l\'antiquité pour en retirer des choses échappées aux esprits les plus curieux. » — La Bruyère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea0b0047-6619-4e2f-a695-e98d45ae9209\', \'multiverseId\': 184117}, \'multiverseid\': 184117}, {\'name\': \'文書管理人\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294d5fe1-1d88-49fa-ae0d-9eafe75d6597\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Arquivista\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f5e5a1-882f-46a2-b554-504315c889e9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Armbrustträger', 'text': '{T}: Der Armbrustträger fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Soldat', 'flavor': 'Peng. Du bist tot.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182652&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4dcb9102-fd10-4d99-b3e7-4082c4cdd696', 'multiverseId': 182652}, 'multiverseid': 182652}, {'name': 'Infantería de ballesta', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96cf726e-4318-4a5a-8f9b-2115cf3f1b4e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Arbalétriers à pied', 'text': '{T}: Ces Arbalétriers à pied infligent 1 blessure à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.', 'type': 'Créature : soldat', 'flavor': 'Dzang. Tu es mort.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184068&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe1cb093-a062-41d4-b8f3-9be451698e3a', 'multiverseId': 184068}, 'multiverseid': 184068}, {'name': '弩弓歩兵', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8977c991-703d-4ac6-a4ca-b2b30ac5cbd3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Infantaria com Balista', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30e14b0b-e6a4-4d8b-8a57-e35aec1ebc82'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Artefaktdiebstahl\', \'text\': \'Du kontrollierst das verzauberte Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182739&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3387351-7b10-405d-9daa-9da53e85ba71\', \'multiverseId\': 182739}, \'multiverseid\': 182739}, {\'name\': \'Robar artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'183b76b1-aa45-4eea-b444-157fd8ee5a38\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Vol d\'artefact", \'text\': "Vous contrôlez l\'artefact enchanté.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c56f8e2-1934-45d1-9d23-77863f1e6009\', \'multiverseId\': 184155}, \'multiverseid\': 184155}, {\'name\': \'秘宝奪取\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf46674-d899-4fea-bcc8-9e44c66128d9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Roubar Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f08d73d-2552-44cc-ac8c-30e1d78c0f21\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Auferstehung der Toten', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Was durch Magie befehligt wird, kann die Erde nicht festhalten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182797&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56b4b232-6bcd-471e-92bf-413a440634e8', 'multiverseId': 182797}, 'multiverseid': 182797}, {'name': 'Alzar a los muertos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9413e9dc-353f-4bfa-bbc3-30c47b5ce037'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Exhumation', 'text': 'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Terre ne peut garder ce que magie réclame.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184213&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d7fcb7a-ede9-4e00-ade2-e3969c877477', 'multiverseId': 184213}, 'multiverseid': 184213}, {'name': '死者再生', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72331ede-9dae-470c-9353-e13a4313f78d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ressuscitar Morto', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1d4e549-382c-4c45-a380-0d156228344a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufgepfropfte Schädelkappe\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zu Beginn deines Ziehsegments eine zusätzliche Karte.\\nWirf am Ende deines Zuges alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeden Tag kämpfe ich um mein Leben und gewinne. Jede Nacht versuche ich, mich meines Namens zu erinnern, und verliere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23607aff-5f2e-45a3-b6de-fa395445025a\', \'multiverseId\': 182938}, \'multiverseid\': 182938}, {\'name\': \'Casquete injertado\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1fff2b0-c619-417a-83ed-7864ac06530a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Calotte greffée\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de pioche, piochez une carte.\\nÀ la fin de votre tour, défaussez-vous de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque jour je combats pour ma vie et je gagne. Chaque nuit je combats pour me rappeler mon nom et je perds. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184354&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55aca309-03de-438d-81ab-a59a89a9440f\', \'multiverseId\': 184354}, \'multiverseid\': 184354}, {\'name\': \'生体融合帽\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba6edd60-8406-41c6-93ef-b3e370169e9f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Solidéu Enxertado\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1097341-3495-4a3b-b818-04dc42039bfe\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausschluss\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Bestimme eine Kreaturenkarte davon. Dieser Spieler wirft diese Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das brauchst du nicht mehr."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10684730-07f5-4f7f-94bb-332b78373c83\', \'multiverseId\': 182793}, \'multiverseid\': 182793}, {\'name\': \'Desterrar\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14117d49-cba0-49d7-9b75-83fc077b7d1f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ostracisme\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Choisissez-y une carte de créature. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Tu n\'auras pas besoin de ça. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'186ac9a4-3479-4561-9bf8-14a616a55314\', \'multiverseId\': 184209}, \'multiverseid\': 184209}, {\'name\': \'村八分\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05f2a28b-0d22-49f4-8acd-25b87b9db3ad\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ostracizar\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ddfa01-fff9-4d2b-a29d-429fc35bfc24\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baldachinspinne\', \'text\': \'Die Baldachinspinne kann blocken, als ob sie Flugfähigkeit hätte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Sie hält die oberen Bereiche des Waldes frei von jeder Bedrohung... außer von sich selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d146d38-2b82-4820-98b8-f7873ab56a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 182874}, \'multiverseid\': 182874}, {\'name\': \'Araña de la enramada\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c692f3-2ee5-4311-b8ba-6d9e9b91065d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Araignée de la canopée\', \'text\': "L\'Araignée de la canopée peut bloquer comme si elle avait le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Plus rien ne reste de dangereux au sommet de la forêt… si ce n\'est l\'araignée elle-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb01d83c-62d2-40c3-a86a-c4b38e5ddd88\', \'multiverseId\': 184290}, \'multiverseid\': 184290}, {\'name\': \'梢の蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7777ae28-a619-4b01-86c3-4b4571e7b829\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aranha Baldaquina\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3ab252a-feae-4448-a174-20a44c23919b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balduvianische Barbaren\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Barbar\', \'flavor\': \'„Von den verschneiten Gipfeln von Kaelor, Zu den Flusstälern von Bandu, Wir trinken und kämpfen, fressen und sterben, Wozu wir geboren wurden." —Balduvianischer Kneipensong\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182813&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284a0955-ef3a-4739-b738-d5365c9f3891\', \'multiverseId\': 182813}, \'multiverseid\': 182813}, {\'name\': \'Bárbaros balduvianos\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'445b77a8-fa58-4a96-bb0e-d549e006bb46\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Barbares balduvians\', \'type\': \'Créature : barbare\', \'flavor\': \'« Des pentes neigeuses de Kaelor aux canyons de Bandou, nous buvons et baisons et mourons car nous ne sommes pas des bande mou. » — Chanson à boire balduviane.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87deb794-2297-4c61-88b5-9e0c4b560566\', \'multiverseId\': 184229}, \'multiverseid\': 184229}, {\'name\': \'バルデュヴィアの蛮族\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d9385b-bac1-4680-9457-399ffe2ac8d5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bárbaros Balduvianos\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fa5a1fe-3119-49c2-a972-f7f2569602b4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumvolk der Rotholzigen\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'Würdest du einem Baumhirte die Rinde abpulen? —Elfenausdruck für „Bist du verrückt?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7678a48b-2213-417a-a92c-9bb6d8106412\', \'multiverseId\': 182904}, \'multiverseid\': 182904}, {\'name\': \'Arbóreos de la secoya\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d9e9e24-cbf9-4cc5-970b-0953c618fcec\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sylvins de Boisrouge\', \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin\', \'flavor\': "Retireriez-vous l\'écorce d\'un sylvin ? — Expression elfe signifiant « Êtes-vous fou ? ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184320&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'528854a5-d816-47e5-a31b-5bed3a38b774\', \'multiverseId\': 184320}, \'multiverseid\': 184320}, {\'name\': \'レッドウッド・ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a310319a-2c2e-4248-a6f6-b6c4251089f7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ents de Redwood\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ef1997-96ee-4adf-a076-2ef861706b37\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumvolksprösslinge\', \'text\': \'Die Widerstandskraft der Baumvolksprösslinge ist gleich der Anzahl an Wäldern, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst der größte Wald hat mit einem Sprössling klein angefangen. —Redewendung aus dem Llanowar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182917&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c96e3640-2d72-4f82-8b5d-10d81547426d\', \'multiverseId\': 182917}, \'multiverseid\': 182917}, {\'name\': \'Pimpollos del pueblo arbóreo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af24d78-8c04-4bec-b241-5b81e918559d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Plants de sylvins\', \'text\': \'Ces Plants de sylvins ont une endurance égale au nombre de forêts que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin\', \'flavor\': "Même la plus grande des forêts vient d\'une graine minuscule. — Diction de la Llanowar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184333&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c39efd1-a29e-4d40-bba6-6527951419bc\', \'multiverseId\': 184333}, \'multiverseid\': 184333}, {\'name\': \'ツリーフォークの若木\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd32652b-d35b-43f4-9d9a-67a416594cbf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Brotos de Ents\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473354ea-3931-4105-abad-74e7092af20d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bedrückende Erinnerungen\', \'text\': \'Schau dir die Karten auf der Hand eines Spielers deiner Wahl an und bestimme davon zwei Karten. Lege diese Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf die Bibliothek dieses Spielers.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich denke nur wenig über die Gegner nach, die ich erschlagen habe. Aber mich bedrücken die Freunde, die ich in den Tod geschickt habe." —Der Paladin des Südens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182757&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbb440c-a1a0-4afd-820f-947c1dee8a52\', \'multiverseId\': 182757}, \'multiverseid\': 182757}, {\'name\': \'Recuerdos agónicos\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1658c61d-dad0-4e87-b8bb-fc0021b2bbdd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Affres du souvenir\', \'text\': "Regardez la main de l\'adversaire ciblé et choisissez-y deux cartes. Mettez ces cartes sur le dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne pense plus aux ennemis vaincus, mais je suis hanté par les amis que j\'ai envoyés à la mort. » —Le Paladin du Sud.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2663a18-0972-47cc-a1c9-53cb4897bd66\', \'multiverseId\': 184173}, \'multiverseid\': 184173}, {\'name\': \'苦悶の記憶\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8d5a966-c2b0-493c-b39e-1b6375a00843\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Lembranças Angustiantes\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a1017d-6a92-43a8-8513-e6faf662b2ac\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beratender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}: Eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Der Segen eines Engels hilft dem Soldaten im Krieg mehr als ausführliches militärisches Training.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af6bb5d0-e377-4c92-98a0-5a16d52336a2\', \'multiverseId\': 182681}, \'multiverseid\': 182681}, {\'name\': \'Abogado de Serra\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6da07e8-d2af-4a4c-95bd-4b37c834c5ea\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Partisane de Serra\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{T}: La créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Le simple toucher d\'un ange prépare mieux à la bataille que des années d\'entraînement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1f69d6-f2ec-42f2-9853-e00bc0dd932f\', \'multiverseId\': 184097}, \'multiverseid\': 184097}, {\'name\': \'セラの代言者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db4a8c41-0475-40db-bb57-7a9195ddf3bf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Advogado de Serra\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e62d1793-e330-48f6-a981-53726ea5c86e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beträchtliche Blüte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Wald für Mana getappt wird, erhöht dessen Beherrscher seinen Manavorrat zusätzlich um {G}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Frühling duftet nach der Magie des neuen Lebens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c17f7e4-3d0c-446b-8309-078beafdc6da\', \'multiverseId\': 182921}, \'multiverseid\': 182921}, {\'name\': \'Florecimiento primaveral\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac2a5787-8055-4720-b5dd-4bc449ca85cd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Floraison printanière\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une forêt est engagée pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute {G} dans sa réserve.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Le printemps apporte la magie de la vie nouvelle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=184337&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10ef043d-e5a0-4eeb-8e70-343ec7392ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 184337}, \'multiverseid\': 184337}, {\'name\': \'花盛りの春\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e351f9-d459-4a6a-9975-85f6ea19bd55\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Florescência Vernal\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0addae7c-0c5b-44d6-9e4e-ca9af13e5677\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bleichholzrüstung\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jeden Wald, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es hat nie einen Zwergenschmied gegeben, der die Wunder schaffen könnte, die Gaea selber schmiedet." —Der Elfische Champion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=182872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f8d923c-ec0