original_text: ["(Walls can't attack.)", "(Walls can't attack.)\\nFirst strike", "(Walls can't attack.)\\nFlying", "(Walls can't attack.)\\nFlying\\nSunweb can't block creatures with power 2 or less.", "(Walls can't attack.)\\no2o\\nUoo\\nU Wall of Wonder gets +4/-4 until end of turn and may attack this turn as though it weren't a Wall.", "(Walls can't attack.)\\noo\\nB Regenerate Wall of Bone.", "(Walls can't attack.)\\noo\\nR Wall of Fire gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "All Elves get +1/+1 and have forestwalk. (They're unblockable as long as defending player controls a forest.)", "All Goblins get +1/+1 and have mountainwalk. (They're unblockable as long as defending player controls a mountain.)", "All Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They're unblockable as long as defending player controls an island.)", 'All creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', 'All creatures are black.', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'All damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to enchanted creature instead.', 'All lands are 2/2 creatures that are still lands.', 'As Engineered Plague comes into play, choose a creature type.\\nAll creatures of the chosen type get -1/-1.', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws a card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player puts the cards in his or her hand on the bottom of his or her library in any order, then draws that many cards.", 'At the beginning of your draw step, draw a card.\\nAt the end of your turn, discard your hand.', "At the end of each player's turn, if that player didn't play a spell that turn, Impatience deals 2 damage to him or her.", 'Attacking creatures you control get +1/+0.', "Attacking doesn't cause Ardent Militia to tap.", "Attacking doesn't cause Standing Troops to tap.", 'B', "Beast of Burden's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures in play.", 'Black creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Blaze deals X damage to target creature or player.', 'Canopy Spider may block as though it had flying.', 'Change the target of target spell with a single target.', 'Charcoal Diamond comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.', 'Choose a color. Target player reveals his or her hand and discards all cards of that color from it.', 'Choose one Target player gains 3 life; or prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'Corrupt deals damage equal to the number of swamps you control to target creature or player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays o1.', 'Counter target spell.', "Counter target spell. Put it on top of its owner's library instead of into that player's graveyard.", 'Creature spells cost o2 more to play.', "Creatures can't block.", "Creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Creatures with power greater than the number of cards in your hand can't attack.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Creatures you control have first strike.', 'Creatures you control have flying.', 'Creatures you control have haste. (They may attack and oc\\nT the turn they come under your control.)', 'Destroy X target nonblack creatures. Draw X cards.', 'Destroy all artifacts and enchantments.', "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy all islands.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target artifact or land. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', "Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target land or nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Discard a land card from your hand: Seismic Assault deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Discard your hand, then draw that many cards.', 'Disorder deals 2 damage to each white creature and each player who controls a white creature.', 'Draw four cards. You lose half your life, rounded up.', 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature in play that shares a creature type with it. (For example, if there are three Goblins in play, each gets +2/+2.)', "Each creature you control can't be blocked by more than one creature.", "Each creature you control can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.", "Each player can't play more than one spell each turn.", 'Each player draws a card for each creature card in his or her graveyard.', "Each player may play an additional land during each of his or her turns.\\nWhenever a land is tapped for mana, return it to its owner's hand.", 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Wildfire deals 4 damage to each creature.', 'Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', "Enchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchanted creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.", 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 for each mountain you control.', 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each forest you control.', 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchanted creature gets +2/+1.', "Enchanted creature gets +2/+2, has flying, and attacking doesn't cause it to tap.", 'Enchanted creature has first strike.', 'Enchanted creature has flying.', "Enchanted creature has swampwalk. (It's unblockable as long as defending player controls a swamp.)", 'Fire Diamond comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool.', 'First strike', 'First strike\\nLongbow Archer may block as though it had flying.', 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike', "Flying\\nAttacking doesn't cause Serra Angel to tap.", "Flying\\nAttacking doesn't cause Skyshroud Falcon to tap.", "Flying\\nGoblin Glider can't block.", "Flying\\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of swamps you control.", "Flying\\nRevenant's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.", 'Flying\\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Abyssal Horror comes into play, target player discards two cards from his or her hand.', 'Flying\\nWhen Cloudchaser Eagle comes into play, destroy target enchantment.', 'Flying\\nWhen Foul Imp comes into play, you lose 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sage Owl comes into play, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card from his or her hand.', "Flying\\nWhenever Bellowing Fiend deals damage to a creature, Bellowing Fiend deals 3 damage to that creature's controller and 3 damage to you.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Sustainer of the Realm blocks, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Thieving Magpie deals damage to an opponent, you draw a card.', "Flying\\no1oo\\nU Return Fleeting Image to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\no2oo\\nU Untap Vigilant Drake', 'Flying\\no\\nX, oc\\nT: Crimson Hellkite deals X damage to target creature. Spend only red mana this way.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Mawcor deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\noo\\nR Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Forestwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a forest.)', 'G', 'Giant Spider may block as though it had flying.', "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Haste (This creature may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)', 'Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player.', "If Static Orb is untapped, players can't untap more than two permanents during their untap steps.", 'If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.', 'Inferno deals 6 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Islandwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls an island.)', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player.', 'Lightning Blast deals 4 damage to target creature or player.', "Look at target player's hand and choose two cards from it. Put them on top of that player's library in any order.", 'Look at the top seven cards of your library. Put two of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', 'Marble Diamond comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool.', "Maro's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.", 'Moss Diamond comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.', 'Mountainwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a mountain.)', "Ogre Taskmaster can't block.", "Okk can't attack unless a creature with greater power also attacks.\\nOkk can't block unless a creature with greater power also blocks.", 'Phantom Warrior is unblockable.', "Phyrexian Colossus doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nPay 8 life: Untap Phyrexian Colossus.\\nPhyrexian Colossus can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.", 'Play Necrologia only during your end of turn step.\\nAs an additional cost to play Necrologia, pay any amount of life.\\nDraw cards equal to the life paid this way.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Put target card from your graveyard on top of your library.', "Pygmy Pyrosaur can't block.\\noo\\nR Pygmy Pyrosaur gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature.', 'Pyrotechnics deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players.', 'R', "Razortooth Rats can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.", "Return all creatures to their owners' hands.", "Return all green permanents to their owners' hands.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to play.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Reveal the first card you draw each turn. Whenever you reveal a basic land card this way, draw a card.', 'Sacrifice Blood Pet: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.', 'Sacrifice any number of artifacts, creatures, and/or lands. Draw a card for each permanent sacrificed this way.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an island.", 'Search your library for a basic land card and put that card into play tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for a basic land card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Sky Diamond comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool.', "Spineless Thug can't block.", 'Spitting Earth deals damage equal to the number of mountains you control to target creature.', 'Squall deals 2 damage to each creature with flying.', "Sudden Impact deals damage equal to the number of cards in target player's hand to that player.", 'Swampwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a swamp.)', 'Take an extra turn after this one. At the end of that turn, you lose the game.', 'Tap all lands target player controls and empty his or her mana pool.', 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Tap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. Choose a creature card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. Choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. You draw a card for each mountain and red card in it.', 'Target player discards three cards from his or her hand.', 'Target player discards two cards from his or her hand.', 'Target player draws four cards.', 'Target player draws two cards.', 'Target player gains X life.', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.', 'Target player untaps all basic lands he or she controls.', 'The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage. You gain that much life.', "Treefolk Seedlings's toughness is equal to the number of forests you control.", 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'U', "Uktabi Wildcats's power and toughness are each equal to the number of forests you control.\\no\\nG, Sacrifice a forest: Regenerate Uktabi Wildcats.", 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. You get an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase this turn.', 'Untapped creatures you control get +0/+2.', 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'W', "Walls may attack as though they weren't Walls.", 'When Dakmor Lancer comes into play, destroy target nonblack creature.', 'When Delusions of Mediocrity comes into play, you gain 10 life.\\nWhen Delusions of Mediocrity leaves play, you lose 10 life.', 'When Goblin Gardener is put into a graveyard from play, destroy target land.', 'When Goblin Matron comes into play, you may search your library for a Goblin card. If you do, reveal that card and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'When Gravedigger comes into play, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Serpent Warrior comes into play, you lose 3 life.', 'When Staunch Defenders comes into play, you gain 4 life.', "When Telepathic Spies comes into play, look at target opponent's hand.", 'When Venerable Monk comes into play, you gain 2 life.', 'When Wood Elves comes into play, search your library for a forest card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', 'Whenever City of Brass becomes tapped, it deals 1 damage to you.\\noc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'Whenever Gang of Elk becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever Goblin Elite Infantry blocks or becomes blocked, it gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Hollow Dogs attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may tap target creature.', "Whenever a black card is put into an opponent's graveyard, you may draw a card.", 'Whenever a creature attacks, Caltrops deals 1 damage to it.', 'Whenever a creature comes into play, its controller sacrifices a creature or land.', 'Whenever a creature comes into play, Æther Flash deals 2 damage to it.', 'Whenever a creature is put into a graveyard from play, you may pay o1. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a forest is tapped for mana, its controller adds o\\nG to his or her mana pool.', 'Whenever a green creature is put into a graveyard from play, its controller discards a card from his or her hand.', "Whenever a land is put into a graveyard from play, Dingus Egg deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", 'Whenever a player plays a black spell, you may pay o1. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a blue spell, you may pay o1. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a green spell, you may pay o1. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a red spell, you may pay o1. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, that player discards a card from his or her hand.', "Whenever a player plays a spell, that player returns a land he or she controls to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever a player plays a white spell, you may pay o1. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a spell or ability an opponent controls puts a land into your graveyard from play, return that land to play.', 'Whenever an island an opponent controls becomes tapped, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a card, Megrim deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent plays a white spell, that player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever an opponent taps a mountain for mana, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Whenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds o\\nG to his or her mana pool.', "Whenever you play a creature spell, you may pay o1. If you do, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever you play an enchantment spell, you may draw a card.', 'Yavimaya Enchantress gets +1/+1 for each enchantment in play.', "You and target opponent each flip a coin. Mana Clash deals 1 damage to each player whose coin comes up tails. Repeat this process until both players' coins come up heads on the same flip.", 'You control enchanted artifact.', 'You control enchanted permanent.', 'You gain 2 life for each card in your hand.', 'You gain 3 life for each black creature target opponent controls.', 'You gain 3 life for each creature attacking you.', 'You gain 4 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.', "You may have Lone Wolf deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Pride of Lions deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Thorn Elemental deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.", 'Your opponents play with their hands revealed.', 'o1: The next time a black source of your choice would deal damage 